Title: Mathematical Function Visualizer
Version: 0.1.0
Description: An R Shiny application that visualizes mathematical functions.
    Users enter expressions (plain math or LaTeX), and the app parses, renders
    them as typeset equations (via MathJax), and plots them with ggplot2.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    shiny,
    bslib,
    bsicons,
    colourpicker,
    ggplot2,
    scales,
    latex2exp,
    latex2r,
    stringr
Suggests:
    shinytest2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    here
